{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52643","headline":"摩诃罗国娑般檀寺述志（题拟） · 慧超","name":"摩诃罗国娑般檀寺述志（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不虑菩提远，焉将鹿苑遥。\n只愁悬路险，非意业风飘。\n八塔难诚见，参着经劫烧。\n何其人愿满，目覩在今朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}